## ✨ Core Features

- **User Registration & Login** — Secure sign-up with email verification, JWT-based sessions stored in iOS Keychain / Android KeyStore.
- **KYC Identity Verification** — AI-powered selfie verification using Amazon Rekognition to approve users automatically.
- **Money Transfers** — ACID-compliant transfers between CLABE accounts, with race-condition protection via PostgreSQL row-level locking.
- **Transaction History** — Paginated ledger queries from DynamoDB, enriched with recipient names from PostgreSQL.
- **Real-Time Notifications** — Push, email, and optional SMS alerts for all account activity via Amazon SNS and SES.
- **Fraud Detection** — Automated fraud scoring on every transaction, with the ability to freeze accounts and file fraud reports.
- **Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)** — Support for SMS, TOTP, and Email-based second factors.
- **AI Chatbot Support** — Amazon Lex-powered conversational support for FAQs and ticket creation.
- **Spending Analytics** — Breakdown of user spending by category over time.
- **Saved Contacts** — Store and favorite frequent transfer recipients.
- **Scheduled Transfers** — Set up recurring payments for a future date.
- **Account Freeze** — Instantly freeze an account if a phone is lost or suspicious activity is detected.

